<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT PAKISTAN BY THREE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT PAKISTAN BY THREE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Pakistan by three wickets in their limited overs World Series match on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores - Pakistan 181-9 in 50 overs (Inzamam-ul-Haq 64, Anthony Stuart five for 26). Australia 182-7 in 49.3 overs (Michael Bevan 79 not out)</p>
